{"sections":[{"slug":"Hecke范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Hecke范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Hecke 范畴"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/约化群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">约化群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子群","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $B$, Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">范畴大致是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">双商叠</span>”\n$$\r\nB \\backslash G / B = \\mathbf{B}B\\times_{\\mathbf{B}G} \\mathbf{B}B\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">上的层范畴</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal H = \\mathsf{Sh}(B \\backslash G / B).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\mathsf{Sh}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是某个层理论</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/D-模","text":"D-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">因此</span> Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">范畴是</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Hecke代数","text":"Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">参考</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/BenZviNadlerChG","text":"Ben-Zvi–Nadler"}},{"Plain":"), <span lang=\"zh\">对</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/叠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">叠</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span> $f\\colon X\\to Y$, <span lang=\"zh\">可定义</span> Hecke <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal H = \\mathsf{Sh}(X\\times_Y X),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $X\\times_Y X\\times_Y X$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $X\\times_Y X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的三个投影映射的推前</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">拉回可定义</span> $\\mathcal H$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/卷积","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/卷积","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">卷积</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}